# round 101 (w119): the solver-free two-media recipe with the MINIMAL medium (SM) as the second medium instead of SC. Round 98 read YPD with SC at 0.896 over six seeds and 0.905 as a fold ensemble, between one medium (0.888, 0.902) and four (0.902, 0.909). Hypothesis, untested: SM differs most from YPD and recovers more. Reads fixed here: six seeds on the released split paired by seed against w116 (YPD with SC), w113 (YPD) and w101 (four media), and the five-fold ensemble against 0.905, 0.902 and 0.909.
